.SH DESCRIPTION
This is a union of libraries with namespaces, import system\&.
.PP
.SH FEATURES
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBNamespace\fR: all of functions starts with "Crt",
to disable it, you can define \fBCRT_NOT_USE_NAMESPACE\fR
and include headers from \fBunsafe/\fR directory\&.
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBImport System\fR: e\&.g\&. for include \fBmem/atexit\&.h\fR you
don'\&t write \fBlibcrt/mem/atexit\&.h\fR, you can define \fBCRT_IMPORT\fR
(maximal value: 6) with \fB"mem/atexit\&.h"\fR and only include
\fBlibcrt/crt\&.h\fR or \fBlibcrt/crt_import\&.h\fR\&.
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBC89\fR/\fBANSI C\fR library code standard\&.
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBstb\-style\fR library
.PP
